---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Services | Rutledge Digital" description="Website development, e-commerce, integrations, and maintenance services.">
  <section class="page-hero section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">SERVICES</p><h1>Website trouble?<br /><span class="accent">I can help.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">Whether you need a new site, a better online store, or help fixing a system that's grown complicated, let's find a practical path forward.</p></section>
  <section class="section-wrap service-list">
    <article class="service-row"><span class="service-index">01</span><div><h2>Website design & development</h2><p>Custom-coded and platform-based websites for local businesses and growing brands. Clear structure, mobile-friendly layouts, accessible content, and performance-conscious implementation.</p><ul><li>New business and marketing websites</li><li>Landing pages and redesigns</li><li>Responsive layouts and performance improvements</li></ul></div><span class="service-icon">↗</span></article>
    <article class="service-row"><span class="service-index">02</span><div><h2>E-commerce & custom features</h2><p>Online shopping experiences that make product discovery and customization simpler. Work can be built into an existing platform or scoped as a custom feature.</p><ul><li>Shopify storefront and theme customization</li><li>WordPress and WooCommerce improvements</li><li>Interactive product selectors and custom workflows</li></ul></div><span class="service-icon">◈</span></article>
    <article class="service-row"><span class="service-index">03</span><div><h2>Integrations & automation</h2><p>Connect systems that don't communicate well, reduce repetitive work, and help information flow reliably between tools.</p><ul><li>API integrations and data synchronization</li><li>Scheduled scripts and workflow automation</li><li>Debugging and legacy system troubleshooting</li></ul></div><span class="service-icon">⟳</span></article>
    <article class="service-row"><span class="service-index">04</span><div><h2>Maintenance & ongoing support</h2><p>Keep an existing website healthier with agreed-upon updates, fixes, and improvements. Every engagement is scoped clearly so expectations are understood.</p><ul><li>Content and layout updates</li><li>Bug fixes and technical troubleshooting</li><li>Maintenance plans with defined response times and limits</li></ul></div><span class="service-icon">⌘</span></article>
  </section>
  <section class="section-wrap note-panel"><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR PROCESS</p><h2>Start with the problem, not the platform.</h2><p>We'll clarify what the site needs to do, who will maintain it, what integrations are required, and what budget makes sense before choosing the technology.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss a project ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>